			"title": "Setting Up a 501(c)(3)",
			"excerpt": "Setting Up a 501(c)(3) (fixture).",
			"content": "Fixture text for the WP-033 install tests. It is not the reviewed Wiki article.\n\n## Do Churches Need to Apply?\n\nA church that meets the 501(c)(3) requirements is exempt without filing an application.\n\n## Which Form to File\n\nFile Form 1023 when your church wants a determination letter. Churches are not eligible for Form 1023-EZ.\n\n## Group Exemption\n\nUnder Rev. Proc. 2026-8, a church can join its denomination's group exemption instead of filing its own application.\n\nSee [Getting your church's EIN](/wiki/administrative/legal/getting-your-churchs-ein) first.\n",
